# The four blocks below carry no `drop` line of their own in content/blocks/, so
# without an item that `places` them they would be the only diggable terrain in
# the game that yields literally nothing. One item each closes that hole.

@item jungle_leaf
name      Jungle Canopy
category  placeable
color     58 150 62
icon      icon_block_cube
places    leavesJungle
stack     99
value     1
desc      Broad, wet, and hiding whatever is directly above you.
tags      plant

